        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our retail malls feature a diverse mix of retail tenants that we believe contribute to increased visitation to our properties and provide a customer amenity that complements our other product and service offerings.",
