        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The renovations of the Tower 3 hotel rooms at Marina Bay Sands into world class suites were completed in the second quarter of 2025, and we are continuing to progress on other property renovations, which include the hotel lobby and SkyPark and additional retail, food and beverage and wellness offerings.",
        "start_character": 41154,
        "end_character": 41458
      },
      {
