        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have subsidiaries incorporated in mainland China and Hong Kong that provide back-office support, such as information technology, accounting, hotel management and marketing services, which complement and support SCL’s main back-office functions in Macao.",
